  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile RNA encoding with avgpool aggregation (config_002) outperforms singleprofile RNA-only models. This experiment tests whether switching to the scvi_n200 RNA encoder (a more sophisticated model than pca_n2000) while maintaining multiprofile and avgpool settings can further improve performance. This isolates the effect of RNA encoder choice, helping determine if the earlier improvement was due to multiprofile data or the specific encoder. It balances exploitation of the multiprofile advantage with exploration of encoder alternatives."
